OL,5,G0930 Essential Classics
OL,6,     FGeorgia Mann plays the best in
OL,7,     Fclassical music, with discoveries
OL,8,     Fand surprises rubbing shoulders
OL,9,     Fwith familiar favourites.
OL,10,G1300 Classical Live
OL,11,     FElizabeth Alker features the best
OL,12,     Fof this year's summer festivals.
OL,13,     FToday, a chance to hear the
OL,14,     FNational Open Youth Orchestra, the
OL,15,     Fworld's first disabled-led
OL,16,     Fnational youth ensemble.
OL,17,G1600 Composer of the Week: Montgeroult
OL,18,     F4/5. Donald Macleod explores the
OL,19,     Ftwists and turns of Montgeroult's
OL,20,     Fprivate life.
